# PWA discoverability

- Google Play: wrap the deployed PWA as a TWA with Bubblewrap or PWABuilder → produces an APK/AAB; requires /.well-known/assetlinks.json on fractale.co + a $25 one-time dev account. The store app is just a shell pointing at the live site.
- Microsoft Store: same via PWABuilder.
- Apple App Store: no direct PWA listing; needs a wrapper + $99/yr, and Apple routinely rejects thin website wrappers. iOS users are meant to use Add to Home Screen.
